<view class="page"><text class="badge">阅读完成</text><text class="title">本次互动报告</text><view class="metrics card"><view><text class="number">{{report.progress || 0}}%</text><text class="muted">完成进度</text></view><view><text class="number">{{proactiveCount}}</text><text class="muted">AI 主动提问</text></view><view><text class="number">{{interruptCount}}</text><text class="muted">用户打断提问</text></view></view><view class="card timeline"><text class="heading">教育维度覆盖</text><view class="dimension-list"><text wx:for="{{report.dimension_coverage}}" wx:key="key" class="dimension">{{item.label}} · {{item.evidence_count}} 条证据</text></view></view><view class="card timeline"><text class="heading">互动记忆时间线</text><view wx:for="{{report.interactions}}" wx:key="interaction_id" class="item"><text class="kind">{{item.interaction_module === 'user_interrupt_question' ? '用户打断提问' : 'AI 主动提问'}}{{item.status === 'skipped' ? ' · 已略过' : ''}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.dimensions_text}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.child_text}}">孩子：{{item.child_text}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.assistant_text}}" class="muted">伙伴：{{item.assistant_text}}</text></view><text wx:if="{{!report.interactions.length}}" class="muted">本次没有产生互动记录。</text></view><text class="boundary">记忆只保存本次互动事实，不提供心理、智力或教育诊断。</text></view>
